  "title": "Welcome to DiaryVault",
  "body":
      "[{\"insert\":\"Welcome to DiaryVault\"},{\"insert\":\": \"},{\"insert\":\"Your Personal Journaling Companion\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":2}},{\"insert\":\"We're \"},{\"insert\":\"delighted\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" to have you onboard, and we're \"},{\"insert\":\"excited\",\"attributes\":{\"italic\":true}},{\"insert\":\" to be your trusted partner in capturing your thoughts, memories and moments 📝\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nExpress Yourself with Rich Text:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Our powerful rich text editor lets you \"},{\"insert\":\"craft your entries\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" just the way you envision them. Add images and videos 📸 to give life to your words and relive your memories.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nLock It Down with Encryption:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Some thoughts are for your eyes only. Lock individual notes with \"},{\"insert\":\"end-to-end encryption\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" 🔒 so they're unreadable without your master password — not even on your synced cloud drive. And keep the app itself private with \"},{\"insert\":\"fingerprint or PIN authentication\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" 🔐.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nMake It Yours with Custom Themes:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Pick from beautiful built-in themes, or \"},{\"insert\":\"create your own custom theme\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" 🎨 — tweak background images, accent colors and glass effects until your journal feels truly yours.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nBuild a Journaling Habit:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"The home dashboard tracks your writing habit: \"},{\"insert\":\"current and longest streaks\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\", total words written and a yearly activity heatmap 🔥. A little journaling every day adds up.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nYour Data, Your Control:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Your privacy 🔏 matters to us. Your journal entries are securely stored in your own \"},{\"insert\":\"Google Drive\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" or \"},{\"insert\":\"Dropbox\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" account. You retain complete ownership of your data.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nOffline First Experience:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"You can use the app to the fullest even when you're offline. Internet is only needed during signup and cloud backup.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nSay Goodbye to Lost Notes:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"DiaryVault automatically saves your notes as you write 💜, so you never lose a precious thought.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nSeamless Cross-Device Sync:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Whether you use DiaryVault on one phone or many, your data is always kept in sync 🔃 and can be fully restored on a new device.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nExport Your Notes:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Export your entries as \"},{\"insert\":\"text files\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" or \"},{\"insert\":\"PDF\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" to share with friends or keep an offline copy for yourself.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nNever Miss a Day with Daily Reminders:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Set up daily reminder \"},{\"insert\":\"notifications\",\"attributes\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"insert\":\" to build your writing routine effortlessly 🔔✍️.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nListen to Your Notes:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"Text-to-speech transforms your written words into spoken ones. Sit back and let your journals come to life 🔊.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\nYour Ad-free Writing Companion:\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":3}},{\"insert\":\"We're dedicated to a precious writing journey that's entirely ad-free and free of cost — no interruptions, no hidden fees 💎.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\n\"},{\"insert\":\"Happy Journaling 🎉\",\"attributes\":{\"italic\":true}},{\"insert\":\"\\nThe DiaryVault Team\\n\\n\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\"}]",
